{"page":"SVIL","gene":"SVIL","accession":"O95425","protein":"Supervillin","length":2214,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"O95425-1","name":"1","synonyms":["Archvillin","p250","SV2"],"notes":[{"topic":"Function","text":"Forms a high-affinity link between the actin cytoskeleton and the membrane. Is among the first costameric proteins to assemble during myogenesis and it contributes to myogenic membrane structure and differentiation (PubMed:12711699). Appears to be involved in myosin II assembly. May modulate myosin II regulation through MLCK during cell spreading, an initial step in cell migration. May play a role in invadopodial function (PubMed:19109420). In addition to its cytoskeletal activities, acts as a cofactor or scaffold for KDM1A, facilitating H3K9me2 demethylation and promoting gene activation, especially in neuronal contexts (PubMed:25684206)"}],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000355867.9","ENST00000860289.1"],"refseq":["NM_021738.3"],"refseqProteins":["NP_068506.2"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-O95425-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-O95425-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":53.4,"plddt":[[0,2],[50,8],[0,89],[50,3],[70,16],[50,1],[70,1],[50,1],[0,474],[50,2],[0,1],[50,2],[0,1],[50,1],[0,88],[50,1],[0,3],[50,12],[0,16],[50,1],[0,88],[50,5],[70,5],[50,4],[0,300],[50,1],[0,1],[70,2],[50,1],[70,3],[50,4],[0,1],[50,1],[0,42],[50,1],[70,1],[50,1],[70,13],[0,1],[50,3],[0,8],[50,6],[70,5],[50,4],[0,2],[50,1],[0,39],[50,3],[0,1],[50,9],[0,25],[50,3],[0,1],[50,2],[0,20],[50,2],[0,10],[50,10],[0,8],[50,1],[0,2],[50,12],[0,9],[50,4],[70,6],[50,2],[70,1],[50,9],[70,3],[50,1],[70,2],[50,4],[0,2],[50,2],[0,14],[50,2],[70,3],[90,11],[70,3],[90,54],[70,1],[90,1],[70,5],[90,7],[70,10],[90,6],[70,14],[90,1],[70,1],[90,16],[70,2],[90,5],[70,2],[90,35],[70,1],[90,14],[70,9],[90,4],[70,11],[90,1],[70,3],[90,2],[70,1],[90,9],[70,1],[90,10],[70,3],[50,2],[0,21],[50,2],[70,2],[90,1],[70,4],[90,1],[70,3],